      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n**Who:**\n- Wilfred Gorefinder [npc=41328]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Advancement\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Burning Dead Robes [item=106473]\n- Elgan's Clue [item=106512]\n- Elgan's Remains [item=107672]\n- Ghost-o-Matic [item=106514]\n- Ghostly Parchment [item=107664]\n- Ophelia's Clue [item=106511]\n- Ophelia's Remains [item=107671]\n- Poira's Clue [item=106513]\n- Poira's Remains [item=107673]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Elgan Tombson [npc=42312]\n- Gibble [npc=42315]\n- Ophelia Bonesnap [npc=42318]\n- Poira the Pale [npc=42319]\n- Slizis Slicetail [npc=42322]\n**Related Quests:**\n- A Matter of Life and Death [quest=6104]\n- Chapterhouse #1: Infiltrating the Burning Dead [quest=6097]\n- Chapterhouse #2: Operation [quest=6101]\n- Raid Expedition: A Matter of Life and Death [quest=6105]\n- Run, You Fools! [quest=6103]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 05:47:22 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task is the third in a series of three. It is a solo task that begins with Wilfred Gorefinder ( map) in the Chapterhouse of the Fallen. He is found at location -325, 930, -91. This is in the southwestern area of the Burning Dead halls in the western half of the zone's second floor._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- Completed \"Infiltrating the Burning Dead\"\n\\- Completed \"Operation\"\n_Note: You must use the \"Burning Dead Robes\" illusion before you can speak with Wilfred (say \"need more robes\" to Sir Birton - map)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Wilfred Gorefinder'\nWilfred Gorefinder says 'You're the new initiate, eh? There's something not right about you, but if Falsin trusts you, I guess I have no choice but to do the same. I can use your help though. There are a lot of tasks that we need to complete before we can turn our full attention to the upcoming ritual. The task I need your help with has me particularly [perplexed].'\nYou say, 'Perplexed?'\nWilfred Gorefinder says 'Someone is killing members of the Burning Dead and raising them as skeletons. This has to stop. We don't know who the murderer is yet. That's where you come in. I want you to [find] whoever is responsible for these heinous crimes and kill them.'\nYou say, 'I will find them'\nWilfred Gorefinder says 'I have just finished working on a device that should help you with your investigation. I call it the Ghost-o-Matic. It is a wondrous contraption that combines the best of gnomish necromancy and tinkering. To use it, simply place the remains of the one you wish to contact into the device along with a piece of ghostly parchment, and a message from the recently deceased will pop out for you to read. I know; it's quite brilliant if I do say so myself. Take the Ghost-o-Matic and this parchment and find the murderer! If you lose your parchment or the Ghost-o-Matic, let me [know], so I can replace them for you. Once you have dealt with the murderer, speak with my assistant, Gibble. I have other matters to attend to.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Dead Gnomes Tell No Tales... Or Do They?'.\nWilfred Gorefinder is investigating a rather curious matter involving members of the Burning Dead being murderer and raised as skeletons, which just isn't right. See if you can help him with his investigation.\n_You receive 1x \"Ghost-o-Matic\" + 3x \"Ghostly Parchment\"._\n\n---\n\n**Map Locs**\n_Locations for your chapterhouse.txt map file:_\nP -411.2793, -231.2680, -254.0211, 0, 127, 0, 3, Elgan\\_Tombson\nP -846.1398, 212.7341, -247.8676, 0, 127, 0, 3, Ophelia\\_Bonesnap\nP -838.3505, -514.9295, -180.6994, 0, 127, 0, 3, Poira\\_the\\_Pale\n\n---\n\nKill Ophelia Bonesnap and loot her remains 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Ophelia Bonesnap ( map) is found in the zone's lowest section - the caverns. Approximate location: -220, 800, -245. This is in the northern part of the caverns' southwestern-most room._\nObtain the first clue 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_In the Ghost-O-Matic, combine 1x \"Ophelia's Remains\" + 1x \"Ghostly Parchment\" to produce \"Ophelia's Clue\"._\n\n---\n\nKill Elgan Tombson and loot his remains 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Elgan Tombson ( map) is located at 225, 420, -250 (this is in the largest room of the caverns -- in the northeastern part of the large room west of the river)._\nObtain the second clue 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_In the Ghost-O-Matic, combine 1x \"Elgan's Remains\" + 1x \"Ghostly Parchment\" to produce \"Elgan's Clue\"._\n\n---\n\nKill Poira the Pale and loot her remains 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Poira the Pale ( map) is located in the northernmost tunnel that leads from the basement caverns to the zone's middle floor._\nObtain the third clue 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_In the Ghost-O-Matic, combine 1x \"Poira's Remains\" + 1x \"Ghostly Parchment\" to produce \"Poira's Clue\"._\n\n---\n\nFind and defeat the murderer 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_The clues read:_\nMy killer has a toothy grin.\nMy killer has scales.\nMy killer has a tail.\n_Slizis Slicetail ( map) can be found swimming back and forth in the underground river in the zone's basement. Note that he sees invisibility and is KOS, but is not social with any other mobs in the zone._\nSlizis Slicetail says 'The Burning Dead wouldn't have me, so they will be punished! All their members will die and so will you!'\n_He hits for a max ~13,000 and casts necromancer spells (no known special abilities and not a particularly difficult fight)._\nSlizis Slicetail has been slain by \\_\\_\\_\\_\\_!\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Gibble 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Note: You need to have the \"Burning Dead Robes\" illusion on in order to get task credit with Gibble ( map)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Gibble'\nGibble says 'So the murderer was an iksar who was angered by the Burning Dead not letting him join? Well I'm glad you have dealt with him. I will let Wilfred know that you have done what was asked of you.'\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience (2 AAs + 2-3% exp in Level 96)",
