      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n**Who:**\n- Aislinn [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a diseased rat - Chapterhouse of the Fallen [npc=42253]\n- a filthy rat [npc=42261]\n- a plague rat [npc=42281]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:47:40 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with a Halfling named Aislinn ( map) in the Chapterhouse of the Fallen. She is found at the zone-in from the Commonlands (southeastern-most room on the main floor)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Aislinn'\nAislinn says 'I see another one of you sniveling adventurers has found your way into The Chapterhouse. I suppose you assume I have some bit of [information] for you?'\nYou say, 'Information?'\nAislinn says 'You'll have to [indulge] me if you want me to point you in the right direction.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Filthy Ankle Biters'.\nAislinn wants you to thin out the number of rats in The Chapterhouse.\n\n---\n\nKill filthy rats 0/10 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_These are found throughout the main floor of the house._\nReturn to Aislinn 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nYou say, 'Hail, Aislinn'\nDeath and disease has long been a part of this place so I doubt this will keep them away for long. I suppose some form of remuneration is called for, so take this for your efforts.\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
