r flesh the stench of purity still clings to their bones.' Aislinn pauses 'But I suppose you must feel pity for them, no? Consider what you did either a justice to me or to the fallen. Whatever helps you sleep at night.'\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
