      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n**Who:**\n- Aislinn [ _Quests_]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a decaying knight [npc=42248]\n- a disgraced knight [npc=42254]\n- a fallen knight [npc=42259]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:47:49 2012\nModified: Tue Dec 5 05:21:04 2023 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a kill task that begins with a Halfling named Aislinn ( map) in the Chapterhouse of the Fallen. She is found at the zone-in from the Commonlands (southeastern-most room on the main floor)._\nYou say, 'Hail, Aislinn'\nAislinn says 'I see another one of you sniveling adventurers has found your way into The Chapterhouse. I suppose you assume I have some bit of [information] for you?'\nYou say, 'Information?'\nAislinn says 'You'll have to [indulge] me if you want me to point you in the right direction.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Steel and Bone'.\nAislinn seems to be under the impression that the knights that oversee The Chapterhouse are not to be trusted. Destroy 10 knights that are stationed throughout The Chapterhouse.\n\n---\n\nKill 10 knights 0/10 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nReturn to Aislinn 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nYou say, 'Aislinn'\nTrust me when I say never before have I created something that has inspired even the slightest bit of fear me until now. The re-animates are supposed to be lifeless toys, but they almost seemed to enjoy their time with a blade.\n_Rewards:_\n112 platinum, 5 gold\nExperience",
