      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n**Who:**\n- Aliskar Darkbane [npc=41351]\nRating:\n0/1**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\n(From 1 rating)\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Quest Items:**\n- Chunk of Stone [item=107670]\n- Glass Jar [item=109136]\n- Shiny Thing [item=106515]\n- Sir Braveblade [item=106478]\n- Slime-Filled Jar [item=109180]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- Baldrik [npc=42309]\n- Oozles [npc=42317]\n- a starving basilisk [npc=42291]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 1\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:47:56 2012\nModified: Tue Jan 21 03:34:28 2025 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This task begins with Aliskar Darkbane ( map) in the Chapterhouse of the Fallen (location 20, 140, 0, in the large room just west of the zone-in from Shard's Landing)._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Aliskar Darkbane'\nAliskar Darkbane says 'Hail, adventurer. Can you spare a moment to [help] me?'\nYou say, 'Help?'\nAliskar Darkbane says 'As you can imagine, being undead has its downsides and some of us can handle it better than others. For example, my poor brother Baldrik is not handling it well at all. The years of undeath he has suffered has severely taken a toll on him. Once a proud paladin, he has been reduced to a gibbering madman. I try to help him when I can, but it has become too dangerous to venture down below to visit him ever since the Burning Dead recently started to appear in great numbers. If you can find it in your heart, please try to [find him] and see if he needs anything.'\nYou say, 'I will find him'\nAliskar Darkbane says 'Thank you. Return to me if you are successful with this task, and I will make sure you are rewarded for your efforts.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Baldrik the Insane'.\nAliskar Darkbane has asked you to take pity on his brother Baldrik who has gone insane. Seek out Baldrik and see if you can help him.\n\n---\n\n**Map Locs**\nP -804.4173, 218.3315, -247.5711, 0, 127, 0, 3, Baldrik\\_(Quest\\_NPC)\nP -389.2286, -164.9582, -251.3892, 0, 127, 0, 3, Oozies\\_(Quest\\_Mob)\n\n---\n\nSpeak with Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Baldrik ( map) is found in the zone's lowest section - the caverns. Location: -220, 800, -245. This is in the northeast corner of the caverns' southwestern-most room._\nYou say, 'Hail, Baldrik'\nBaldrik shouts at you. 'Oozles! Where has Oozles gone?! You must find Oozles and return him to me!' Baldrik throws as glass jar to you. 'That is Oozles' home. Put him in there! Don't lose jar. If you lose jar, I have [more] though.'\nYou say, 'I need more!'\nBaldrik throws a glass jar to you.\n_You receive a Glass Jar._\nCapture Oozles 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Find Oozles (an ooze -- map) in the lowest level of the zone (the caverns, at about 165, 390, -250). Fight it to 25% and right-click the jar._\nGive the Slime-Filled Jar to Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nSpeak with Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nCollect shiny things for Baldrik 0/6 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_These appear as ground spawns in the lowest part of the zone (the caverns). They appear as yellow icons on the ground and are prelootable._\nGive the shiny things to Baldrik 0/6 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nSpeak with Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nLoot a Chunk of Stone from a basilisk 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nGive the Chunk of Stone to Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nSpeak with Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nFind Sir Braveblade 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This is a doll that drops from oozes, basilisks, beetles, and tentacle terrors._\nReturn Sir Braveblade to Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nSpeak with Baldrik 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nSpeak with Aliskar Darkbane 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Rewards:_\n225 platinum\nExperience (3 AAs)",
