      walkthrough = "Quest Started By: | Description:\n**Where:**\n- Chapterhouse of the Fallen [zone=874]\n**Who:**\n- Grimbus [npc=41352]\nRating:\n0/0**_\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*__\\*_**\nInformation:\n**Level:** | 100\n**Maximum Level:** | 125\n**Monster Mission:** | No\n**Repeatable:** | Yes\n**Can Be Shrouded?:** | No\n**Quest Type:** | Task\n**Quest Goal:**\n- Experience\n- Money\n**Time Limit:** | 06:00:00\n**Quest Items:**\n- Bag of Unwanted Body Parts [item=107663]\n**Related Creatures:**\n- a bloody disposal crate [npc=42242]\n- a deteriorating disposal crate [npc=42250]\n- a dilapidated disposal crate [npc=42252]\n- a dusty disposal crate [npc=42256]\n- a filthy disposal crate [npc=42260]\n- a gory disposal crate [npc=42266]\n- a reanimated bodypart [npc=42428]\n- a scavenging basilisk [npc=42427]\n**Era:** | !Rain of Fear\nRecommended:\n**Group Size:** | Solo\n**Min. # of Players:** | 1\n**Max. # of Players:** | 6\n**Appropriate Classes:**\n- All\n**Appropriate Races:**\n- All\nEntered: Thu Nov 29 09:48:00 2012\nModified: Tue Feb 20 00:30:12 2024 | | **Rain of Fear Information & Guides: An Overview \\| Group Progression & Task List \\| Raid Progression \\| Visible Armor**\n\n---\n\n_This is a shared task (1-6 players) that begins with Grimbus ( map) in the Chapterhouse of the Fallen. He is found at location 475, 185, -220 (in the lowest part of the zone; the far north end of the underground river)._\n_Note: This task locks as soon as you obtain it._\n_Pre-Requisites:_\n\\- Level 85\n\\- No tasks\nYou say, 'Hail, Grimbus'\nGrimbus says 'I don't get many visitors down here. Are you looking for some [work]? If you have a strong stomach, I may just have something for you.'\nYou say, 'Work?'\nGrimbus says 'I was once part of the Burning Dead necromancers. Somehow I managed to anger the wrong person and as punishment, I was sent down here to dispose of unwanted body parts that are left over from necromantic experiments. It's a hard, lonely life, but I keep going. Lately though I have been unable to attend to my duties due to an [injury].'\nYou say, 'Injury?'\nGrimbus says 'As I was placing some body parts into the disposal crates one day, a basilisk, attracted to the smell of the rotting flesh, appeared and attacked me. I got away, but not without one of my legs being turned to stone. I can barely walk now. Hopefully it will heal on its own, but in the meantime, I am unable to dispose of the body parts. Do you think you can [help]? I don't own much, but I will find something to reward you for your help.'\nYou say, 'I can help'\nGrimbus says 'Thank you. The job itself isn't too difficult. Simply pick up the bags of unwanted body parts that are thrown down the chute into the river and place them into one of the disposal crates. Slimes will appear and dissolve both the crates and the body parts. They are rather efficient cleaners. There are a couple of [problems] you will need to keep an eye out for however.'\nYou say, 'What problems?'\nGrimbus says 'Sometimes scavenging basilisks appear to try to eat the body parts. As you can probably understand, I hate basilisks. Kill any that may show up. Also, that strange, purple shard here in the caverns can sometimes cause [strange things] to happen.'\nYou say, 'What strange things?'\nGrimbus says 'On occasion, some of the body parts will be affected by the shard's dark magic and come to life. Mostly it's severed hands, which is just plain creepy. Kill any of those that may appear as well. The last thing I need is a bunch of severed hands crawling all over me when I try to sleep. You best be on your way. The body parts are really starting to pile up. Good luck.'\nYou have been assigned the task 'Feeding Time'.\nGrimbus wants you to help him dispose of some unwanted body parts by collecting them near and in the river and then placing them in various disposal crates.\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the dusty, bloody, gory, filthy, dilapidated, and deteriorating disposal crates. Kill any scavenging basilisks that may appear when you place the body parts into the crates. Kill any reanimated body parts that may appear when you place the body parts into the crates.\n\n---\n\n_Bags of Unwanted Body Parts spawn all over the lower caverns (many ground spawns in the water). You will need six of these._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the dusty disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the area almost due west of Grimbus. You will have \"a scavenging basilisk\" to contend with here._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the bloody disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the area northwest of Grimbus. You will have a reanimated body part to contend with here._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the gory disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the large area southwest of Grimbus. You will have \"a scavenging basilisk\" to contend with here._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the filthy disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the room east of the dilapidated crate. You will have a reanimated body part to contend with here._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the dilapidated disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the west-central room of the zone's lower caverns. You will have \"a scavenging basilisk\" to contend with here._\nPlace a Bag of Unwanted Body Parts into the deteriorating disposal crate 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_This crate is located in the southwest room of the zone's lower caverns. You will have a reanimated body part to contend with here._\nKill scavenging basilisks 0/3 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\nKill reanimated body parts 0/3 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_The above two steps update as you complete the task._\nSpeak with Grimbus 0/1 (Chapterhouse of the Fallen)\n_Rewards:_\n150 platinum\nExperience (2 AAs)",
